        heading: "Fast-track delivery for Lake Charles projects",
        body: "Battery projects in the Lake Charles area move on the industry's timeline — sites picked fast, production dates that don't move. We deliver fast-track: phased bid packages so site work and foundations proceed while process areas are still being designed, utility coordination starting in week one, and permit pre-submittals running in parallel with design. I'm Jeremy Mills, CEO & Founder of Apex Grid Engineering and a U.S. Air Force veteran; I'm not a PE — our licensed professionals make the technical, sealing, and project-specific decisions. Best price and fastest turnaround is how a veteran-owned firm wins work against giants: quotes back fast, honest schedules, and engineering that keeps construction moving.",
